# Repo-root ignores. The per-package ignores (app/, mcp/, create/, extension/,
# registry/) cover their own build output; this file exists because there was no
# root one, and a vitest run started from the REPO ROOT wrote
# node_modules/.vite/... which then got committed and shipped to the public
# mirror in v2026.08.21 (harmless content, but a fresh clone of the kit came out
# with a stray node_modules directory in it).
node_modules/
.vite/
.DS_Store
*.log
